A '''hyperlane''' branched off the [[Rimma Trade Route]] at the [[Kriselist system]] and headed southeast through the [[Mid Rim Territories]], passing through [[Onod]], [[Tiferep Major]], the [[Chroman system]],<ref name="Map" /> [[Ogem]], and ended at [[Karfeddion]] in the [[Senex sector]].<ref name="TFABG" />

{{Route-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
In the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, this hyperlane was known as the [[D'Aelgoth Trade Route]] and was mapped in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]''. The southernmost part of the route was part of the [[Senex-Juvex Loop]], a circular route in the Senex and [[Juvex sector]]s that has not been fully depicted in the current [[canon]].<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

